# The root image pipeline (docs/design.md, "Root-task image and address
# space"): xtask builds user/root, strips it, checks it with
# l4core::boot::image and embeds it in .rootimage. The kernel finds the
# section through the linker's symbols, page-aligned at the end of its
# read-only data and holding exactly the file, runs the boot checks on it,
# makes the boot plan the root task's needs give on this machine, and lists
# the VSpace boot step 8 would build: the paging structures, then the image
# frames by permission, the IPC buffer and BootInfo's two frames, each slot
# checked against the capability boot puts there.
cmdline: test=rootimage
exit: success
expect: microL4 kernel
expect: cmdline: "test=rootimage"
expect: rootimage: .rootimage
expect: rootimage: at physical
expect: rootimage: the root ELF passes the boot checks: entry 0x400000, image 0x400000-
expect: rootimage: IPC buffer at
expect: rootimage: needs a TCB, a PML4, 1 PDPT, 1 PD, 1 PT and
expect: rootimage: boot region
expect: rootimage: slot 17: Pdpt at
expect: rootimage: slot 18: PageDirectory at
expect: rootimage: slot 19: PageTable at
expect: map 0x400000- # the text frames
expect: RX,
expect: RW, NX, 0 file bytes # the stack, above an unmapped guard page
expect: rootimage: slots 10-10: 1 frame at # the IPC buffer
expect: rootimage: slots 9-9: 1 frame at # BootInfo's first frame
expect: rootimage: slots 16-16: 1 frame at # and its second
expect: rootimage: every slot holds the capability boot step 8 maps
expect: TEST PASS
